me. Every disaster is uniquely yours.<br><br><strong>Note:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C.A.R.S. uses large numbers of physics-driven vehicles and real-time destruction simulations. This intentional design makes the game more CPU-intensive than typical indie titles. Please ensure your system meets the minimum requirements for a smooth experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discord</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please join our Discord to add feedback, submit bugs and give suggestions to future updates &lt;3<br></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>By 3Dads Studios</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three Norwegian fathers.<br>One chaotic idea.<br>Zero excuses.</p>", "short_description": "A rebellious chaos sandbox where you weaponize junk, disrupt highway traffic, and engineer outrageous physics disasters to turn the morning commute into pure, glorious mayhem.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“It's incredibly satisfying to experiment with physics and see what absurd chain reactions you can create. It's a perfect time-waster.”<br>Ulvespill<br><br>“Streamers and content creators, in particular, will find a lot to love here, as the game naturally produces unpredictable and entertaining moments”<br>10 Out of 10 Magazine<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226780/f2942b6487cbe05dc90eebad2a838055e9b6ccdb/header.jpg?t=1772282241", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226780/17904cae8e3616f0c70bfe1fa19264fe6566a967/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772282241", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4226780/17904cae8e3616f0c70bfe1fa19264fe6566a967/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772282241", "website": "https://www.3dads.no/cars/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit p